

>> Cat := Yam-khoom tshiab.

Cat thaum-tuaj: ['tshiab'] ua: {
	nws-li sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat thaum-tuaj: ['nieuw'] ua: {
	nws-li sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat thaum-tuaj: ['makeSound'] ua: { <- nws-li sound.
}.

Cat thaum-tuaj: ['greet'] ua: { <- tus-kheej makeSound.
}.

>> cat := Cat tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: cat greet.
